              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 6.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Rwa rusengero rwuzura umwotsi uva mu bwiza bw'Imana no mu mbaraga zayo, ntihagira umuntu n'umwe ubasha kurwinjiramo kugeza aho bya byago birindwi by'abo bamarayika barindwi byarangiriye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
